sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client (browser / Lab)
  participant M as RequestMonitor
  participant X as request_inputs
  participant S as InputScanner
  participant D as Demo app
  participant R as EventRepository

  C->>M: GET /demo/search?q=' OR '1'='1
  M->>X: extract_request_inputs(path, query, body)
  X-->>M: fields [("q", "' OR '1'='1")], username
  M->>M: locked? request rate under limit?
  M->>S: scan_inputs(fields)
  S->>S: SqlInjectionDetector: rule "Quote-based tautology" + ML score
  S-->>M: [Finding(SQL Injection pattern, HIGH)]
  alt HIGH and blocking on
    M->>R: add_event(..., HIGH, "Blocked (demo)")
    M-->>C: 403 Blocked by SentinelWeb
  else no finding
    M->>D: call_next(request)
    D-->>M: 200 results
    M->>R: add_event(..., SAFE, "Allowed")
    M-->>C: 200
  end
